                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/3409: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-23T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 23, 1920—8
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>187. Referring to final question in our 180 of July 16, 2 p.m. and to your 191,
                    noon, July 21. Who made suggestion upon which Ministers acted and what form did
                    action take? We are waiting for report.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
